<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia prices unchanged, trade slow.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia prices unchanged, trade slow.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate (DAP) and ammonia prices were unchanged Wednesday, cash sources said.</p>
<p>Although trade was quiet, there is increased interest from dealers wanting to take on inventory before the start of the U.S. Midwest spring planting season, sources said.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  176-178		     up 1</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    188-189		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	  220-225		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
